  "details": "I found a VRChaptics plugin that I'm interested in for my Oculus Quest and bHaptics. But the only problem is. The guy who made the plugin says the plugin uses a window capture feature which doesn't support Oculus Quest. The only way I can use bHaptics on VRChat with Quest, the game must have some haptic features for the game. So can you do me and Tsubokura a favor and add some haptic features, or at least native bHaptics support, to VRChat on Oculus Quest, please? Haptics is really important (Especially for bHaptics' haptic feedback suit) because it helps increase immersion a bit.",
